[
  {
    "RowId": 37646,
    "Text": "I said I'd help. What more do you need? "
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37647,
    "Text": "Revising threat assessment... Integrating additional tactics into stratagem."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37648,
    "Text": "The statue grew! But how!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37649,
    "Text": "It really is impressive, but I'd rather not wait around for it to try and squash us again."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37650,
    "Text": "I knew following you was the right move. Apologies, but I'm afraid the treasure is ours!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37651,
    "Text": "Huh? What happened to the mist?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37652,
    "Text": "Ah, the cushion broke your fall! How oddly considerate of her..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37653,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37654,
    "Text": "Oh my... The statue is carved into the tree itself! Could it be the Speaker Kalika serves!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37655,
    "Text": "Show me what you're made of!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37656,
    "Text": "Water's in the air, and I'll bend it to my will!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37657,
    "Text": "Show me what you're made of!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37658,
    "Text": "In any other situation, these crystals would be enchanting."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37659,
    "Text": "That crystal is different from the others. I'd keep a wide berth if I were you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37660,
    "Text": "A bubble seems to be holding one crystal aloft. We should keep an eye on that..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37661,
    "Text": "The bubbles make the crystals light as air. A single gust of wind will send them flying!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37662,
    "Text": "There he is again! He said he'd help us, but can we trust him?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37663,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>に恩返しをしに来たなんて、\nあのヒト、意外と義理堅いだす。"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37664,
    "Text": "There he is again! He doesn't look happy to see us..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37665,
    "Text": "まったく、厄介なヒトだっただす……。\n<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>、大丈夫だすか？"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37666,
    "Text": "Watch out! The wind howls again!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37667,
    "Text": "泡がたくさん出てきただす！\n当たらないように避けたほうがいいかも……？"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37668,
    "Text": "こんなに手ごわい相手と戦えるなんて、\n<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>はやっぱり、すごいヒトだす……！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37669,
    "Text": "Are <i>we</i> the intruders!? What could we be intruding upon?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37670,
    "Text": "Are you feeling yourself, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>? Your eyes looked...empty."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37671,
    "Text": "The direction of its magicks don't match the patterns. What puzzle is it putting before us?"
  },
