  {
    "RowId": 38000,
    "Text": "From dreams of endless Dark, I awaken."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38001,
    "Text": "O stifled Darkness in moon abiding..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38002,
    "Text": "Coalesce and consume creation!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38003,
    "Text": "My Darkness shall devour all Light."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38004,
    "Text": "You shall know no hope, nor salvation!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38005,
    "Text": "I shall rend the very walls of reality!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38006,
    "Text": "Further! I must go further!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38007,
    "Text": "Beyond the veil my home doth lie..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38008,
    "Text": "What is this place? Wherefore am I here?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38009,
    "Text": "Stand aside, I beseech you."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38010,
    "Text": "I wish but to return home."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38011,
    "Text": "In my memory the stars yet shine, attending the moon..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38012,
    "Text": "Bright as stars in the night."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38013,
    "Text": "Her will...<i>my</i> will...shall not be denied."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38014,
    "Text": "The time is come to rejoin the great flow."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38015,
    "Text": "By my power shall all know salvation!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38016,
    "Text": "To the last you would deny my heart's desire..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38017,
    "Text": "Your flesh shall melt and seethe!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38018,
    "Text": "Begone, contemptible Light!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38019,
    "Text": "This world is beyond salvation."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38020,
    "Text": "'Tis time to set forth─for warmth and radiance!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38021,
    "Text": "Your souls are mine!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38022,
    "Text": "Ah, the Darkness! It riseth!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38023,
    "Text": "All are as one in Darkness."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38024,
    "Text": "Be at peace in oblivion."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38025,
    "Text": "In Darkness be steeped."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38026,
    "Text": "At the heart of primordial Darkness..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38027,
    "Text": "The kindling of life's spark..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38028,
    "Text": "The glory of creation!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38029,
    "Text": "Oh, to look upon such splendor once more..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38030,
    "Text": "Return to me, my beloved star!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38031,
    "Text": "All who oppose me shall be consigned to nothingness."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 38032,
    "Text": "In endless Dark embrace your end."
  },
